THE F WORD — 10-bit frame, 16-state superframe

  F is a 16-bit word over the superframe (same as mf8_16.py).
  Acquisition wants 32 consecutive matches.

  Longest run of consecutive frames a payload lane matches the word.

  word                                       CVSD speech  CVSD silence    constant 1    constant 0        random    octet 0xFE    octet 0xAA      period-2
  1010..  period 2                                    23          8192             1             1            12             3          8192          8192
  0101..  period 2, other                             23          8192             1             1            12             3          8192          8192
  0111..1  one zero at 0                              16             3            15             1            18            15             3             3
  1111..10  one zero at 15  (wrap)                    16             3            15             1            18            15             3             3
  1111..01  one zero at 14                            16             3            15             1            18            15             3             3
  1111111011111110  0xFE repeated                     13             3             7             1            20          8192             3             3
  1111..00  two zeros                                 16             2            14             2            19             8             2             2

  0xFFFE is the same wrap as the 16-bit line: one NAND of q3..q0.

